@WorkoutTracker_HostAddress = http://localhost:5274

### 1. Получить все упражнения (GET)
GET {{WorkoutTracker_HostAddress}}/api/exercises
Accept: application/json

### 2. Добавить новое упражнение (POST)
POST {{WorkoutTracker_HostAddress}}/api/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bench Press",
  "muscleGroup": "Chest",
  "weightKg": 80,
  "reps": 8
}

### 3. Обновить упражнение с Id = 1 (PUT)
PUT {{WorkoutTracker_HostAddress}}/api/exercises/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bench Press",
  "muscleGroup": "Chest",
  "weightKg": 85,
  "reps": 6
}

### 4. Удалить упражнение с Id = 1 (DELETE)
DELETE {{WorkoutTracker_HostAddress}}/api/exercises/1
